<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="/xslt/main.xsl"?>	<page pid='/errpage/40x'>		<content><warnmessage>		<msgtitle>啊呀</msgtitle>		<msgcontent>		<div class="RoundedCorner"> <b class="rtop"><b class="r1"></b><b class="r2"></b><b class="r3"></b><b class="r4"></b></b> 下载链接好像有点问题？请<a onclick='go_back()' href='#'>返回重试</a> <b class="rbottom"><b class="r4"></b><b class="r3"></b><b class="r2"></b><b class="r1"></b></b> </div>		<br/>请您通过Email<a href='#' onclick='javascript:location.href="mailto:admin@assrt.net?subject=射手网(伪)页面bug&amp;body=错误发生页面:"+location.href;return false;'>报告指向此页面的网址，以便我们锁定和解决问题。</a>。</msgcontent>		</warnmessage>		</content>	<script src="/js/errpage.js" type="text/javascript"></script></page>
